Subject: [PATCH] net: zte: preview SR7420 warm LAN-only handover and RX diagnostics

Validated on SR7420 using native Linux 6.18.60 initramfs via kexec,
with inherited RTL8372N initialization. This patch does not enable any
board DTS, establish cold reset, or provide a flashable image.

Add the optional zte,lan-only path, optional SR7420 warm-switch path,
software RX diagnostics, and narrowly matched inherited VLAN row adoption.
The paired modules must be rebuilt together because their shared ABI changes.

Apply after this workspace's Linux 6.18 series (baseline recorded in the
source manifest). Do not replace the in-tree Makefile with the external one.

